    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Autoclave Solutions A and B separately at 121ºC. Cool to 50ºC."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "comment": "Aseptically add Solution B to Solution A. Mix very well."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "comment": "Rehydrate IsoVitalex according to package instructions and add aseptically to medium."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "comment": "Mix well and dispense into appropriate vessel."
